### Create Exercise
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bench Press",
  "muscleGroup": "CHEST",
  "description": "Barbell bench press"
}

### Get all Exercises
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercises

### Get Exercise by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/e2aa1faa-802a-4b01-b92f-486c7bd8612a

### Update Exercise
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/e2aa1faa-802a-4b01-b92f-486c7bd8612a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incline Bench Press",
  "muscleGroup": "CHEST",
  "description": "Incline barbell bench press"
}

### Delete Exercise
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/e2aa1faa-802a-4b01-b92f-486c7bd8612a